cs along with UG / PG degree\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eGood understanding of PowerBI Analytics, Data Flows, SQL, Cloud Solutions (Azure) + Python.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience in Snowflake, MS Fabric, Tabular Editor, Paginated reports, Power automate \u0026 dbt\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBuild and maintain scalable data models using modern tools (e.g., Snowflake, dbt). Translate defined business logic into clean and reusable datasets.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience in supporting Analytic solution roll outs and working across different time zones.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience managing projects or working towards a deadline.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWorking with clients or customers internal or external.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience working in an Agile/DevOps environment using design thinking methodology.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience with effective communication at different levels in the organization.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWillingness to accommodate work schedules that align with onsite hours \u0026 weekend schedules\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eUpskill on new technologies to implement on the job / new business requirement\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStrong attention to detail and ability to ensure data accuracy\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAbility to work with global teams across time zones\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eClear communication skills\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCommunicate data issues, variances, and root-cause findings with clear analysis and r