3e\u003cp\u003e- create modular, well-structured scripts and reusable components for analytics.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e- create high-quality visualizations and convert technical analysis into meaningful business themes\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSkills\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e3–6 years of experience in data analysis, business process analysis, task mining or process mining.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong proficiency in SQL and Python/Pandas for data transformation and analysis (Pandas, NumPy, regex, data manipulation).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAbility to handle large data sets and work with structured and semi-structured event data\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUnderstanding of enterprise workflows, multi-application work patterns, and human-in-the-loop processes is a plus\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFamiliarity with ML techniques such as clustering, sequence alignment, pattern mining, or similar analytical methods.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExcellent communication skills with the ability to translate technical insights into clear business language.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong attention to detail and a passion for understanding how work truly gets done at scale.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e","Data Analyst II",null,null,0,[["organization","Skan.ai"],["organization_mid","/g/11jdn6drnb"],["publisher_name","Foundit"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bae1670c9b44e6d:0xf8dfc3e8517e4fe0"],["cluster_id","0x08a7185502a34026"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"kvn4aunMNpCe4-EP6dygqAQ66":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.40079606,4]]],"kvn4aunMNpCe4-EP6dygqAQ78":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+5+yea