c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eInterpret regulatory instructions and translate them into business and functional requirements.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePartner with Regulatory Reporting SMEs to document reporting obligations and reporting logic.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAssess impacts of new products, acquisitions, regulatory changes, and remediation initiatives on existing reports.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eBusiness \u0026 Data Analysis\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003ePerform detailed data analysis and data lineage assessments across source systems and reporting platforms.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eIdentify strategic and non-strategic data sourcing requirements.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eDefine data quality rules, reconciliation requirements, variance thresholds, and exception reporting criteria.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAnalyze MDRM, reporting attributes, calculations, and reporting hierarchies where applicable.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eRequirements Management\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003ePrepare Business Requirement Documents (BRDs), Functional Requirement Documents (FRDs), user stories, and process flows.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eFacilitate requirements workshops with business, regulatory, operations, and technology teams.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eTranslate regulatory requirements into detailed Jira stories and acceptance criteria.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSupport backlog refinement and prioritization activities.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eQualifications:\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eEducation\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eBachelor's degree in Finance, Accounting, Economics, Information Systems, Business Administration, or related field.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cb\u003eExperience\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e5+ years of experience in regulatory reporting, finance transformation, business analysis, or data management.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience supporting regulatory reporting change initiatives within banking or financial services would be preferred\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience working in Agile and Waterfall delivery environments.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience in Axiom/ A360 or Workiva would be preferred.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e \u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003ch1\u003e\u003cspan class\u003d\"emphasis-3\"\u003e\u003cb\u003eAbout State Street\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cp\u003eAcross the globe, institutional investors rely on us to help them manage risk, respond to challenges, and drive performance and profitability. We keep our clients at the heart of everything we do, and smart, engaged employees are essential to our continued success.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe are committed to fostering an environment where every employee feels valued and empowered to reach their full potential. As an essential partner in our shared success, you’ll benefit from inclusive development opportunities, flexible work-life support, paid volunteer days, and vibrant employee networks that keep you connected to what matters most. Join us in shaping the future.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs an Equal Opportunity Employer, we consider all qualified applicants for all positions without regard to race, creed, color, religion, national origin, ancestry, ethnicity, age, disability, genetic information, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, citizenship, marital status, domestic partnership or civil union status, familial status, military and veteran status, and other characteristics protected by applicable law.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr /\u003e\u003cp\u003eDiscover more information on jobs at \u003ca target\u003d\"_blank\" href\u003d\"http://statestreet.com/careers\"\u003eSt