e a great fit for this role or other open roles. We are seeking candidates who model our values: invest in every relationship, lead with curiosity, champion diverse perspectives, turn inputs into actions, and uphold trust through integrity. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSkills and Competencies\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e2 to 5 years of experience in data management, data quality, data governance, or related analytical functions\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong knowledge of structured finance products, including Residential Mortgage-Backed Securities, Asset-Backed Securities, Commercial Mortgage-Backed Securities, and Collateralized Loan Obligations\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience working with data acquisition, validation, enrichment, cleansing, and Master Data Management initiatives\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAdvanced SQL skills with the ability to analyze, transform, and manage large datasets\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eStrong analytical and problem-solving skills, including root cause analysis and process improvement\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExcellent communication and collaboration skills with the ability to work effectively across global and cross-functional teams\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eExperience with Python, VBA, automation, or scripting tools is preferred\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eKnowledge of project management practices and software development lifecycle methodologies is preferred\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEducation\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eBachelor's degree in Business, Finance, Economics, Data Management, Information Systems, Computer Science, or a related field required/ MBA or equivalent graduate degree preferred\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResponsibilities\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eSupport the acquisition, management, governance, and quality of structured finance data to enable downstream products, analytics, and business growth\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eManage the end-to-end production lifecycle for structured finance datasets, including agency and non-agency residential mortgage-backed securities, asset-backed securities, commercial mortgage-backed securities, and collateralized debt obligations\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAcquire, validate, transform, and maintain data to support analytics products and operational processes.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eMonitor data quality, investigate discrepancies, and implement corrective actions to ensure data accuracy, consistency, and completeness\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eCoordinate vendor operations by managing submissions, resolving inquiries, defining requirements, establishing acceptance criteria, and approving deliverables\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003ePartner with Data Operations and Development teams to prioritize requirements, create and track work items, and support production activities\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEstablish and maintain structured asset data governance processes, standards, and controls\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eLead initiatives focused on data cleansing, enrichment, and process optimization to improve operational efficiency and data integrity\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eContribute to enterprise-wide data quality and Master Data Management initiatives\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEvaluate and recommend new technologies, tools, and best practices that enhance data management capabilities\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eSupport cross-functional stakeholders through analysis, reporting, and continuous improvement efforts\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout the Team\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOur Content Solutions - Structured Finance team is responsible for acquiring, managing, and delivering high-quality structured finance data that powers Moody's analytics solutions and client offerings\u003cbr\u003eBy joining our team, you will:\u003cbr\u003eHelp drive the quality, accuracy, and coverage of structured finance datasets used across Moody's products\u003cbr\u003eCollaborate with global teams across data operations, technology, and product functions\u003cbr\u003eContribute to innovative data management and governance initiatives that support business growth and operational excellence\u003c/p\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cp\u003eMoody’s is an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, sex, national origin, disability, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender expression, gender identity or any other characteristic protected by law.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eCandidates for Moody's Corporation may be asked to disclose securities holdings pursuant to Moody’s Policy for Securities Trading and the requirements of the position. Employment is contingent upon compliance with the Policy, including remediation of positions in those holdings as necessary.\u003c/p\u003e","Data Management Analyst",null,null,0,[["organization","Moody's"],["organization_mid","/g/12345mf2"],["publisher_name","Careers At Moody's"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bae1670c9b44e6d:0xf8dfc3e8517e4fe0"],["cluster_id","0x2dc7e9a5e299e3b6"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"kvn4aunMNpCe4-EP6dygqAQ64":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[43911100,0.13485856,4]]],"kvn4aunMNpCe4-EP6dygqAQ75":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Analyst+in+Bengaluru+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003dbeD8dqkvG_RoudVOAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_xXOMQrCQBBAUWxzBBunE0R